      <link>https://www.phillyvoice.com/camden-firefighter-dies-after-falling-through-ice-delaware-river/?utm_source=pv-rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=pv-site</link>
      <description>A Camden firefighter died Thursday morning after falling into the icy water of the Delaware River at Wiggins Waterfront Park, officials said. The firefighter fell into the water during a maintenance check on the department's fire boat.</description>
