      <title>Dirty Franks adopts 25-and-older policy to 'save the bar' from underage drinkers using fake IDs</title>
      <link>https://www.phillyvoice.com/dirty-franks-age-limit-fake-ids-dive-bar-center-city/?utm_source=pv-rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=pv-site</link>
      <description>Center City dive bar Dirty Franks now has a 25-and-up age limit due to crowds of young people presenting suspicious IDs that trick scanners but appear to be fake. The bar plans to keep the new rule until it finds a reliable system to detect fake IDs.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.phillyvoice.com/dirty-franks-age-limit-fake-ids-dive-bar-center-city/?utm_source=pv-rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=pv-site</guid>
